##########################################################
             Instalação do Zabbix em 2 CAMADAS
            ( Zabbix e banco de dados Mysql separados)
##########################################################

Sistema Operacional:
- Ubuntu 22.04


Instalação do Zabbix (Servidor Zabbix)
###############################################

1. Instalar o Repositório Zabbix 7.0

wget https://repo.zabbix.com/zabbix/7.0/ubuntu/pool/main/z/zabbix-release/zabbix-release_7.0-1+ubuntu22.04_all.deb
sudo dpkg -i zabbix-release_7.0-1+ubuntu22.04_all.deb

sudo apt update

2. Instalar Pacotes Zabbix e Cliente MySQL

sudo apt install zabbix-server-mysql zabbix-frontend-php zabbix-nginx-conf zabbix-sql-scripts zabbix-agent mysql-client -y

3. Importar o Schema Inicial

zcat /usr/share/zabbix-sql-scripts/mysql/server.sql.gz | mysql --default-character-set=utf8mb4 -u zabbix -p -h "IPDOSERVIDORDB" zabbix

4. Configurar o servidor Zabbix

sudo vi /etc/zabbix/zabbix_server.conf

ARQUIVO Zabbix_server.conf

DBHost= IP do seu Servidor de Banco
DBName=zabbix
DBUser=zabbix
DBPassword= SenhaSegura

5. Configurar o Nginx

sudo vi /etc/zabbix/nginx.conf

ARQUIVO nginx.conf

listen 80;
server_name zabbix.empresa.com; # Ou coloque o IP


Instalação do Mysql 
###############################################

1. Instalar o Mysql

sudo apt update
sudo apt install mysql-server -y

2. Inicie o serviço e remova as configurações inseguras de fábrica

sudo mysql_secure_installation

Y
Y
Y
Y
Y

3. Configurando um Usuário Admin

sudo mysql

-- Criar um novo usuário chamado 'admin' (ou outro nome que preferir)
CREATE USER 'admin'@'localhost' IDENTIFIED BY 'sua_senha';

-- Dar permissão total a ele (igual ao root)
GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON *.* TO 'admin'@'localhost' WITH GRANT OPTION;

-- Aplicar as mudanças
FLUSH PRIVILEGES;

-- Sair
EXIT;

6. Testando o acesso

mysql -u admin -p


Configuração do Mysql
#############################################

1. Acessando o console

sudo mysql -u root -p

2. Criar Banco e Usuário Zabbix

create database zabbix character set utf8mb4 collate utf8mb4_bin;
create user zabbix@'IP_servidor' identified by 'senhauser';
grant all privileges on zabbix.* to zabbix@'IP_servidor';
set global log_bin_trust_function_creators = 1;
quit;

3. Liberar Acesso Remoto
